# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lovable Cloud project exports — NEVER COMMIT
# These contain personal data (user emails, profiles) and bcrypt password
# hashes from auth.users. Inspect schema only; never print row data.
# Patterns are deliberately broad because the exact filename Lovable emits
# has not been confirmed — widen further rather than risk a commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*export*.sql
*export*.sql.gz
*export*.zip
*export*.tar
*export*.tar.gz
*export*.dump
*export*.backup
lovable-export*/
bidintel-export*/
supabase-export*/
*.pgdump
*.dump
